      "body": "## What\r\nTest-only fix for the two unit tests that keep `stage-b-test-1-gpu-small-amd-mi35x` red on main.\r\n\r\n## Why\r\nBoth partitions fail on every scheduled run since Oct 19, e.g. [partition 0](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39421857090/job/118624623384) and [partition 1](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39421857090/job/118624623363).\r\n\r\n- `test_dsv41_bcg_hip.py`: `AssertionError: 2 != 1` on the captured page-table width. Since #43733 the HIP backend captures and replays the DeepSeek-V4.1 prefill graph at `prefill_cuda_graph_default_max_seq_len` (16K) when no `max_seq_len` is configured, instead of the bucket's own length. The page table is that limit clamped to the `req_to_token` width (512 in the fixture), so 2 pages, not 1.\r\n- `test_dsv4_hip_bcg_metadata.py`: `AttributeError: 'types.SimpleNamespace' object has no attribute 'swa_req_ring_size'`. Since #44673, `get_dspark_swa_page_indices` reads `swa_req_ring_size` and `swa_valid_from` from the KV pool, and the test's mock pool doesn't have them.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n- `test_dsv41_bcg_hip.py`: take the limit from `backend._graph_metadata_max_seq_len(capture_batch)`, which is what capture and replay actually use. Build the eager reference at that limit and expect `ceil(min(limit, req_to_token width) / page_size)` columns. This also turns on the existing limit branch (eager rebuild at the limit, overflow raises), which had no caller before.\r\n- `test_dsv4_hip_bcg_metadata.py`: add `swa_req_ring_size=None` and `swa_valid_from=None` to the mock pool. These match the real pool's paged-SWA defaults.\r\n\r\nNo library code changes.\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n- [x] `stage-b-test-1-gpu-small-amd-mi35x` on rocm10 via dispatch: https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39541960302. Both partitions passed (31/31 and 32/32). `test_dsv41_bcg_hip.py` ran 1 test and `test_dsv4_hip_bcg_metadata.py` ran 19 tests, all OK.\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:hourglass_flowing_sand: [Run #39541983320](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39541983320)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39541983266](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39541983266)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39541983278](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39541983278)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
